- 1.0.0-beta.2
  A scroll view scrolls sideways or both ways, with a bar along its foot, and brings an element into view either way.
  The wheel turns as a Vector2, Shift and the wheel turning it sideways: OnWheel, InputRoot.Wheel, Workspace.Wheel and
  WheelEventArgs.Amount take a Vector2 now. A text area takes a sideways turn too.
- 1.0.0-beta.1
  First release, a beta: the API can still change between versions.
